{"product_id":"drip","title":"Drip Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eDrip Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep up your tech game with the Drip Smartwatch, where innovation meets elegance. Make every day more productive and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep up with your lifestyle.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOrder your Drip Smartwatch today and embrace the perfect blend of technology and fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Drip Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Drip Smartwatch is loaded with features to keep you ahead of the game. Track your fitness goals with precision using advanced sensors for heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay connected with smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered up throughout your busy day, and with customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps, you can easily switch up your style to suit any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Drip Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 390 x 390 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 10 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP67 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 42g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Drip SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Drip Smartwatch means opting for a device that enhances your lifestyle with its superior functionality and chic design. Its comprehensive health tracking, smart connectivity, and stylish aesthetics make it a standout choice in the smartwatch market. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a seamless experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Golden","offer_id":48217347850518,"sku":"20089","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":48217347916054,"sku":"20091","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":48217347948822,"sku":"20088","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48217347883286,"sku":"20085","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Gold_-1_bb04367a-a9f7-42c5-acef-05bd659db6c5.webp?v=1737804486","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/drip","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}